    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated within the mature and highly regarded Rockvale development, No. 23 is an attractive two-bedroom semi-detached residence offering bright, comfortable and well-maintained accommodation in a particularly convenient Castlebar location. Extending to approximately 78.7 square metres (847 square feet), the property is presented in good condition throughout and is ready for immediate occupation. It represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those wishing to downsize or investors seeking a manageable home in an established residential setting.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged over two floors, with a practical layout that makes excellent use of the available space. A welcoming entrance hallway leads into a bright and inviting living room, providing a comfortable setting in which to relax and unwind. To the rear of the property, the kitchen and dining area offers a functional everyday living space with ample room for dining and direct access to the garden.\n\nAt first-floor level, there are two generously proportioned bedrooms, each benefiting from its own ensuite shower room. This unusual and highly practical arrangement provides excellent privacy and convenience, making the home equally suitable for an individual, a couple, a small family or those who may wish to share the property. Both bedrooms enjoy good natural light and offer comfortable accommodation with scope for a new owner to personalise the décor to suit their own individual style.\n\nThe interior has been carefully maintained, with large windows allowing natural light to flow through the rooms and creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. While ready to move into, the property also provides a wonderful blank canvas for purchasers who may wish to introduce their own decorative touches or carry out further enhancements over time.\n\nOutside, a private driveway to the front provides convenient off-street parking. Gated access leads to an enclosed side and rear garden, offering a secure and easily managed outdoor space. The garden has the potential to accommodate a children's play area, additional landscaping or a pleasant patio for outdoor dining and relaxation during the warmer months.\n\nRockvale is a well-established residential development that has remained consistently popular with owner-occupiers due to its mature surroundings and convenient position. Castlebar town centre is within easy reach, placing an extensive selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, schools and sporting facilities close at hand. Mayo University Hospital and many of the town's other major amenities are also readily accessible, while excellent connections to the N5 and the wider road network make travel to Westport and surrounding areas straightforward.\n\nCombining a practical layout, generous bedrooms, private parking and an enclosed garden, No. 23 Rockvale is a very appealing home with much to offer. Its excellent condition and sought-after location should ensure broad interest, and early viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - 4.6m x 1.96m\nwith ceramic floor tiles.\n\nLiving Room - 4.5m x 3.6m\nwith ceramic floor tiles and open fireplace.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.6m x 4.52m\nwith fitted kithen units, ceramic tiling. utility closet for additional storage and sliding patio doors to the rear patio and garden.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nHallway - 3.78m x 2.06m\nwith hot press and attic access.\n\nBedroom - 5.16m x 4.52m\nwith wooden floor, fitted wardrobes and en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.03m x 2.41m\nwith wc, wash hand basin and shower unit.\n\nBedroom - 3.5m x 3.18m\nwith wooden floors, fitted wardrobes and en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.73m x 1.73m\nwith wc, wash hand basin and shower unit.\n\n"
      },
